-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §19 מורה משלב/ת: an integrating teacher
-- works a special-education teacher's week, with 3 individual and 7 stay
-- hours in a primary school and 2 and 11 in a junior high school.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-18`
§ `19 מורה משלב/ת`

-- akn:art_19 The opening: §18's week, with the changes in (א)–(ב).

@ref akn:art_19__para_a akn:art_19__para_b
GIVEN stage IS A `school stage`
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `an integrating teacher's full week` stage IS
    IF stage EQUALS `a primary school`
    THEN `a week of` ((`a special-education teacher's full week` stage)'s `frontal hours`) 3 7
    ELSE `a week of` ((`a special-education teacher's full week` stage)'s `frontal hours`) 2 11

-- The changes move individual hours to stay hours and leave the week at 36.
#ASSERT `hours of the week` (`an integrating teacher's full week` `a primary school`) EQUALS 36
#ASSERT `hours of the week` (`an integrating teacher's full week` `a junior high school`) EQUALS 36
